* Tue Oct 27 2026 kapitaali <teppo@kapitaali.com> 0.1.0-1
- Share a file, folder or webpage as an encrypted kelp:// link and serve it
  directly on the local network
- Open links on another device: passphrase unlock, save-folder choice,
  per-file progress and verified, decrypted downloads
- Content-addressed, AES-256-GCM-sealed object store; links carry the key in
  the fragment and passphrase-protected links wrap it instead
- LAN-only serving with Wi-Fi-only and low-battery policy, background
  keepalive, and a remembered share list with pause, resume and stop
- Offline webpage preview for shares published as a page
- Settings for storage, logging and local-address inclusion; About page
- Sailjail permissions Internet and UserDirs only
